  IconPath: icons/magic/fire/flame-burning-embers-yellow.webp
  Description: Focusing your will into your physical attacks imbues them with mystical
    energy. Your unarmed attacks become magical, allowing them to get past resistances
    to non-magical attacks. However, you still need an item such as Handwraps of
    Mighty Blows (+1) to gain an item bonus to attack rolls or increase your attacks'
    weapon damage dice.
